Package: hp-fingerprint-mouse-support
Version: 1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-cryptography, python3-yaml, python3-dbus, python3-gi, libpam-fprintd, fprintd, usbutils, udev
Maintainer: Antigravity AI <support@local>
Description: Linux driver & D-Bus service support for HP USB Fingerprint Mouse (06cb:00c3)
 Provides native hardware initialization, microcode firmware loading,
 and D-Bus bridging to fprintd / PAM authentication for the Synaptics
 biometric sensor inside the HP USB Fingerprint Mouse.
